{
 "encounter_id": "00616",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Morning. I've got a meeting at ten, so can we keep this quick? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll be as quick as we can. Your booking says routine check. Anything in particular on your mind? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just the usual health check the company pays for. Oh, and my headaches keep coming back, by the way."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me about them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tight, like a band round my forehead. Mostly late afternoon at my desk."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has that been going on, and how bad do they get?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About three months. Mild, honestly. It's more of a nuisance than anything."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any nausea with them, or changes in your vision?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No nausea, and my vision's fine. Sleep's fine too, before you ask."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any tablets you take regularly?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Candesartan, 8 mg once a day, for my high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And are you allergic to anything, medicines especially?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. Came up in a rash when I was a kid, so they've kept it off my list ever since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Any heart disease or strokes in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dad had a heart attack at sixty. That's really why I come for these checks every year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sensible. Let me do your numbers. Sit back for me and rest your arm on the table. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cuff always feels tighter than it needs to. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 128 over 80, pulse 68, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, and you're 84 kilos.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All right indeed. Any cough, wheeze or breathlessness when you're active?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. I run on Saturdays and have no trouble at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain, palpitations or ankle swelling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None of that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your shoulders are tight and the neck moves freely. A couple of tender knots across the top, nothing sinister.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, they do ache if I press them. So is it anything serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing in what you've told me or what I've found sets off any alarm bells. Since you're on candesartan, I'd like to check your cholesterol and kidney function with a blood test too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. Where do I do that? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Reception will give you a form for the lab downstairs. It's walk-in, you don't need an appointment. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Great. Any tips for the headaches themselves? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take a screen break every hour, raise your monitor a little, and drink water through the afternoon. Your shoulders will thank you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Easy enough. Do I need to come back about them? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not unless they get worse or change in character. If they do, ring the surgery rather than waiting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Perfect. I might actually make my meeting after all. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good luck with it. ~"
  }
 ],
